# Beyond Information Retrieval: Ways To Provide Content in Context.

**Authors:** Wiley, Deborah Lynne

## Abstract
Provides an overview of information retrieval from mainframe systems to Web search engines; discusses collaborative filtering, data extraction, data visualization, agent technology, pattern recognition, classification and clustering, and virtual communities. Argues that rather than huge data-storage centers and proprietary software, we need distributed systems and linkages. Lists Web sites of companies mentioned. (PEN)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ572256

